          "field": "consistency",
          "verdict": "issue",
          "quote": "\"**Go on** + -ing means continue; **go on to do** means do something next.\" / \"*Go on doing* means continue the same thing; *go on to do* means do a new thing next.\"",
          "severity": "minor",
          "family": "other",
          "reason": "The same learner guidance is duplicated in the learner-error note and the entry-level adaptation note."
        },
        {
          "field": "coverage",
